_tag\" >KNOCK OUT WARLORDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match against powerful Warlords that have specific strategies and unique gladiators - some prefer assassins, while others focus on spellcasters. Find their weaknesses and win them enough times, to challenge them to a boss battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Warlord has their own unique Champion, a powerful gladiator that will be tough to take down. Kill them and take their heads as trophies while you climb the ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010900/extras/ceb5c9c6e21a8b4720cba74334d0482e.poster.avif?t=1755350730\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010900/extras/ceb5c9c6e21a8b4720cba74334d0482e.webm?t=1755350730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010900/extras/ceb5c9c6e21a8b4720cba74334d0482e.mp4?t=1755350730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
